=head2 DeploymentType => Str

Specifies the deployment mechanism through which the update shall be
applied on the domain. Possible responses are C<Blue/Green> (The update
will require a blue/green deployment.) C<DynamicUpdate> (The update can
be applied in-place without a Blue/Green deployment required.)
C<Undetermined> (The domain is undergoing an update which needs to
complete before the deployment type can be predicted.) C<None> (The
configuration change matches the current configuration and will not
result in any update.)


